{
"si": 176,
"ei": 0,
"src": "Who are the Heptarchs?"
},
{
"si": 176,
"ei": 1,
"src": "Oh. Am I allowed to talk about them? I don't think so."
},
{
"si": 176,
"ei": 2,
"src": "I can tell you this much: They're a bunch of eccentrics."
},
{
"si": 176,
"ei": 3,
"src": "I wish I had a villa of my own, too."
},
{
"si": 176,
"ei": 4,
"src": "If I owned a villa, I would furnish it with the most exquisite and beautiful treasures. And people."
},
{
"si": 176,
"ei": 5,
"src": "You would be part of it, too."
},
{
"si": 176,
"ei": 6,
"src": "Uhm..."
},
{
"si": 176,
"ei": 7,
"src": "Ohhhhh. That's a nice sentiment, isn't it?"
},
{
"si": 176,
"ei": 8,
"src": "What's with all the guards here?"
},
{
"si": 176,
"ei": 9,
"src": "Ohhhhh. Hehe."
},
{
"si": 176,
"ei": 10,
"src": "It's because I am important. Kind of."
},
{
"si": 176,
"ei": 11,
"src": "Even more so since the mistress is away on some adventure."
},
{
"si": 176,
"ei": 12,
"src": "Sure, she said it's not an adventure. I bet she's having fun though."
},
{
"si": 176,
"ei": 13,
"src": "Oh, and there was the break-in, of course. Need to have some guards to secure the whole estate."
},
{
"si": 176,
"ei": 14,
"src": "I found Hevla's engram."
},
{
"si": 176,
"ei": 15,
"src": "An engram? Of our Heptarch?"
},
{
"si": 176,
"ei": 16,
"src": "Oh, sweet. This might actually let us peek into her quarters and see what she’s hiding."
},
{
"si": 176,
"ei": 17,
"src": "I guess I have to grant you the right of first entry."
},
{
"si": 176,
"ei": 18,
"src": "Please, take a look at the Archives. I'll follow you shortly."
},
{
"si": 176,
"ei": 19,
"src": "Can you show me the site of the break-in?"
},
{
"si": 176,
"ei": 20,
"src": "Hevla's Archives?"
},
{
"si": 176,
"ei": 21,
"src": "Absolutely not."
},
{
"si": 176,
"ei": 22,
"src": "You look gorgeous, that's a plus, but I don't know yet if I can trust you."
},
{
"si": 176,
"ei": 23,
"src": "Ohhh, I guess I could let you see the place now."
},
{
"si": 176,
"ei": 24,
"src": "Here's a key. Just for you."
},
{
"si": 176,
"ei": 25,
"src": "The entrance is in the back of the Villa."
},
{
"si": 176,
"ei": 26,
"src": "Well, you have her engram. You can take a look now."
},
{
"si": 176,
"ei": 27,
"src": "I need you to look out for something that fits this need."
},
{
"si": 176,
"ei": 28,
"src": "Alright. Got it."
},
{
"si": 176,
"ei": 29,
"src": "I think I have that exquisite taste you wanted."
},
{
"si": 176,
"ei": 30,
"src": "Sweeet."
},
{
"si": 176,
"ei": 31,
"src": "What is it?"
},
{
"si": 176,
"ei": 32,
"src": "It's the taste of Morrowmeat, after easing his suffering."
},
{
"si": 176,
"ei": 33,
"src": "Aaah. The taste of a Titan, marinaded with stress and ailment, and finally garnished with some reprieve."
},
{
"si": 176,
"ei": 34,
"src": "Yes, that's a fitting relish as answer to my request."
},
{
"si": 176,
"ei": 35,
"src": "Give it to me."
},
{
"si": 176,
"ei": 36,
"src": "I appreciate that. You did well."
},
{
"si": 176,
"ei": 37,
"src": "How would I gain your trust?"
},
{
"si": 176,
"ei": 38,
"src": "Ambitious. I like that."
},
{
"si": 176,
"ei": 39,
"src": "There's something that would require a bit of discretion."
},
{
"si": 176,
"ei": 40,
"src": "I want to expand my palate. Advance my way towards taking part in the human experience."
},
{
"si": 176,
"ei": 41,
"src": "I want to collect a definite case of human delight: Tasting something extraordinary."
},
{
"si": 176,
"ei": 42,
"src": "OK. So what is it exactly that you want?"
},
{
"si": 176,
"ei": 43,
"src": "I don't know, sweetie. Part of the pleasure will be that I won't know beforehand what I will get."
},
{
"si": 176,
"ei": 44,
"src": "You might try finding a specialist at the market."
},
{
"si": 176,
"ei": 45,
"src": "Anything else you need to get done?"
},
{
"si": 176,
"ei": 46,
"src": "Actually, yes."
},
{
"si": 176,
"ei": 47,
"src": "Now we're getting to the bottom of it. Sweet, sweet bottom."
},
{
"si": 176,
"ei": 48,
"src": "My mistress got involved with a Titan. Before the mistress left us."
},
{
"si": 176,
"ei": 49,
"src": "That Titan is called Mother, and there are all sorts of stories about her circulating here in our Crystal City."
}
